b: instance is u 1, expr ref obj 1
d: instance is u 1, expr ref obj 1
din: instance is u 1, direction input, size 8, scalar 0, signed 1, vector 1, ranges 1 7:0, typespec exists 1, typespec ranges 1 7:0, same bounds 1, left/right io 7:0 typespec 7:0 same 1
dout: instance is u 1, direction output, size 4, scalar 0, signed 0, vector 1, ranges 1 3:0, typespec exists 1, typespec ranges 1 3:0, same bounds 1, left/right io 3:0 typespec 3:0 same 1
rp: instance is u 1, ref 1, expr ref obj 1
scalar: instance is u 1, direction input, size 1, scalar 1, signed 0, vector 0, ranges 0, typespec exists 1, typespec ranges 0, same bounds 1
vec: instance is u 1, direction output, size 8, scalar 0, signed 0, vector 1, ranges 1 7:0, typespec exists 1, typespec ranges 1 7:0, same bounds 1, left/right io 7:0 typespec 7:0 same 1
vif: instance is u 1, expr virtual interface var 1
task t io declarations:
  ti: back with vpiTaskFunc 1
  to: back with vpiTaskFunc 1
  tr: back with vpiTaskFunc 1
