function f io declarations:
  fi: back with vpiTaskFunc 1
udp io declarations:
  a: back with vpiUdpDefn 1
  b: back with vpiUdpDefn 1
  o: back with vpiUdpDefn 1
ports of u:
  din: port 1, interface port 0, modport port 0, index 0
  dout: port 1, interface port 0, modport port 0, index 1
  b: port 0, interface port 1, modport port 0, index 2
  d: port 0, interface port 0, modport port 1, index 3
